<%- include('partials/head') %>

<body class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-100 to-fuchsia-200 min-h-screen text-gray-800">
  <%- include('partials/header') %>
  <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center text-purple-700 mb-8">About Us</h1>
      
      <div class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-fuchsia-600 mb-4">Our Story</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Founded in 2023, we began as a small team passionate about creating meaningful digital experiences. 
          What started as a simple idea has grown into a thriving community of creators, innovators, and problem-solvers.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Today, we're proud to serve thousands of customers worldwide with our unique solutions and commitment to excellence.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-fuchsia-600 mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
          We believe in making technology accessible, intuitive, and joyful to use. Our mission is to bridge the gap between 
          complex solutions and end-users through thoughtful design and innovative engineering.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-fuchsia-600 mb-4">Meet The Team</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-purple-50 p-6 rounded-lg text-center">
            <div class="w-24 h-24 mx-auto mb-4 bg-purple-200 rounded-full"></div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-800">Alex Johnson</h3>
            <p class="text-purple-600">Founder & CEO</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-fuchsia-50 p-6 rounded-lg text-center">
            <div class="w-24 h-24 mx-auto mb-4 bg-fuchsia-200 rounded-full"></div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-fuchsia-800">Sam Lee</h3>
            <p class="text-fuchsia-600">Lead Developer</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-purple-50 p-6 rounded-lg text-center">
            <div class="w-24 h-24 mx-auto mb-4 bg-purple-200 rounded-full"></div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-800">Taylor Smith</h3>
            <p class="text-purple-600">Design Director</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-fuchsia-600 mb-4">Want to Join Us?</h2>
        <p class="text-lg mb-6">We're always looking for passionate people to join our team.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-fuchsia-500 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-medium hover:shadow-lg transition-all">
          Contact Us
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  
</body>
</html>